msgid ""
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again with the new password. Backups "
"made earlier still open with the password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Allt i valvet krypteras om med det nya lösenordet. Säkerhetskopior som "
"gjorts tidigare öppnas fortfarande med lösenordet de skapades med."

msgid "Everything is in sync"
msgstr "Allt i synk"

msgid ""
"Everything returns to how it was when the copy was made, including "
"attachments and password history. Entries created later disappear. The "
"current vault is kept in a file next to it."
msgstr ""
"Allt återgår till hur det var när kopian gjordes, inklusive bilagor och "
"lösenordshistorik. Poster som skapats senare försvinner. Det aktuella valvet "
"sparas i en fil bredvid."

msgid "Everything was already in sync"
msgstr "Allt var redan synkroniserat"

