msgstr "Slutför synkronisering"

msgid ""
"First export your passwords from the other app, then choose that file here. "
"Before importing you will see what was recognized. Delete unprotected export "
"files afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Exportera först dina lösenord från den andra appen och välj sedan filen här. "
"Innan import ser du vad som kändes igen. Ta bort oskyddade exportfiler "
"efteråt."

msgid "Folder"
msgstr "Mapp"

msgid "Folder created"
msgstr "Mapp skapad"

msgid "Folder name"
msgstr "Mappnamn"

msgid "Folder removed. Its passwords were kept."
msgstr "Mappen togs bort. Dess lösenord behölls."

msgid "Folder renamed"
msgstr "Mapp omdöpt"

msgid "Folders"
msgstr "Mappar"

msgid ""
"Folders organize your passwords. You can choose them when adding or editing."
msgstr ""
"Mappar organiserar dina lösenord. Du kan välja dem när du lägger till eller "
"redigerar."

msgid "Follow the system"
msgstr "Följ systemet"

msgid ""
"For Nextcloud, the base URL looks like https://cloud.example.com/remote.php/"
"dav/files/USERNAME"
msgstr ""
"För Nextcloud ser bas-URL ut som https://cloud.example.com/remote.php/dav/"
"files/ANVÄNDARNAMN"

